{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：18:50 2026-09-25 HKT<br/>發佈時間：18:50 2026-09-25 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：18:50 2026-09-25 HKT</p><p>中秋佳節，一年一度的大坑舞火龍如約而至，由迎月夜（24日）起一連三日舉行。中秋節正日（25日），全長67米、點滿12,000枝長壽線香的大火龍，不單在銅鑼灣大坑浣紗街舞動至銅鑼灣道，更會延伸至維多利亞公園，《星島頭條》全程直播大坑舞火龍盛會。</p><img alt=\"年度盛事「大坑舞火龍」一連三日舉行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/600443be175098c2dc20adeb3fa61659/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260924_214410563_04.jpg\"/><img alt=\"工作人員為舞火龍作準備。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/25fb0b9946f995e64d31357d36354bb6/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260924_214410563_10.jpg\"/><img alt=\"年度盛事「大坑舞火龍」一連三日舉行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9f64e75b44cdf7e960102de842e79335/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260924_214410563_08.jpg\"/><img alt=\"「大火龍」全長67米、點滿12,000枝長壽線香。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/162a0f6e93c51d56901fcb4698bf84dd/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260924_214410563_07.jpg\"/><img alt=\"街道兩旁的市民旅客紛紛歡呼，拿出手機拍下火龍身影。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/47746d8dab1fdf30d5cd162c6046fb38/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260924_214410563_01.jpg\"/><img alt=\"火龍其後穿梭大坑大街小巷，祈求合境平安。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/00eebd64c0e6dd8e0b05bd80b41e319d/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260924_213756087.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/74c3cb1c7a20824d1604c493610e4a90/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260924_213756087_02.jpg\"/><img alt=\"「大火龍」點滿12,000枝長壽線香。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/20449aa2798b2ee812392192a707ccb7/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260924_214410563_11.jpg\"/><img alt=\"有市民特意早到「霸位」拍攝火龍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/384da3d2ba81524765207e574ecc3e7d/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260924_214410563_09.jpg\"/><img alt=\"有外國旅客認為氣氛十分熱鬧，亦有內地旅客表示在活動現場感受到文化共融。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ef8bf9034d0b57cd3156dae1e319950f/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260924_213756087_12.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2f6b7f39196afba5df71c9bd2f6e3d58/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260924_213756087_11.jpg\"/><img alt=\"大會預計3日的舞火龍活動，合計會有超過9萬名市民及旅客到場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c23ce8b05e65f3ded18ee85c740e5e73/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260924_213756087_20.jpg\"/><img alt=\"專程來港觀賞舞火龍的旅客料達3萬人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c76d6deafd2c8f40189e7648078a56b/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260924_213756087_25.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T10:58:25.599831+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":204,"images":13,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}